== About me
I am currently an assistant professor of the [https://iai.xmu.edu.cn/ Institute of Artificial Intelligence], [https://www.xmu.edu.cn/ Xiamen University]. I received my M.S. and Ph.D. degrees from [https://www.sysu.edu.cn/ Sun Yat-sen University] in 2021 and 2025, respectively, where I was advised by [https://chenliang.tech/ Prof. Liang Chen] and [https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=zWnsNrkAAAAJ&hl=en Prof. Zibin Zheng].

My research interests include: 
- Trustworthy Graph Learning: reliability, fairness, etc.
- Graph Neural Networks
- Generative Recommendation
- Large Language Models

